        <p style="font-size:13px;font-family:Times New Roman;">
            <b>18. NOTICES</b>
        </p>
        
        <p align="justify" style="font-size:13px;font-family:Times New Roman;">
            <b>18.1</b> Any notice or communication required or permitted under this
            Agreement shall be in writing and shall be sent to the address, email address,
